
# ── Conventional Commits ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# <type>(<scope>): <subject>          subject ≤ 72 chars, imperative, no period
#
# <body>                              wrap at 72; say why, and what changed in
#                                     behaviour, not how the diff reads
#
# <footer>                            BREAKING CHANGE: …   Refs: #123   Closes #45
#
# type:  feat  fix  refactor  perf  test  docs  build  ci  chore  revert
# scope: the area touched (pipeline, watcher, infra, docs, deps …)
# !      after the type/scope marks a breaking change: feat(api)!: …
#
# One logical change per commit. No AI attribution trailers.
# These # lines are stripped; everything else above them is the message.
